 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "Light for «ويهديكم», geometric near Allah's names, two paths for «أن تميلوا ميلا عظيما», a leaf for «خلق الإنسان ضعيفا», coins only on the permitted «تجارة» (no motif on the forbidden «أموالكم بينكم بالباطل» or on «ولا تقتلوا أنفسكم»). 26:6 «سنن الذين من قبلكم» (the prophets' ways) has no motif. STAGING v4: 26-28: believers sit in a town and read (26:3, the clarification of His law), raise their hands on 26:10 (He turns to them) and bow on 27:4; those who follow their desires appear only while their wish is recited (27:7 to 28:1): they speak and point at the believers on 27:11 (two paths plate, ended before the Name); the believers are not shown deviating. 28: the believers, close shot on the easing (28:4), bow on 28:8 (created weak, leaf plate). 29: believers in a market; the forbidden taking of wealth is not acted; a buyer speaks, pays the seller on 29:12 (trade, coins plate) and the seller agrees on 29:14 (mutual consent). Nothing is shown for the prohibition of killing (29:16-18): wide shot only."
